{"repo": {"name": {"en-US": "Inkwell"}, "description": {"en-US": "Self-hosted F-Droid repo for Inkwell, a native reader and writer for the Standard.site publishing ecosystem on AT Protocol. Source: https://github.com/ewanc26/inkwell"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/icons/inkwell-icon.png", "sha256": "19910613cbdd0b525178968b2f996942ed762f95f569339c0dce0e847fd2e805", "size": 8544}}, "address": "https://inkwell.ewancroft.uk/fdroid/repo", "timestamp": 1786863873000, "categories": {"Internet": {"name": {"en-US": "Internet"}}, "Reading": {"name": {"en-US": "Reading"}}}}, "packages": {"uk.ewancroft.inkwell": {"metadata": {"added": 1786830341000, "categories": ["Internet", "Reading"], "changelog": "https://github.com/ewanc26/inkwell/releases", "issueTracker": "https://github.com/ewanc26/inkwell/issues", "lastUpdated": 1786863812000, "license": "AGPL-3.0-only", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/ewanc26/inkwell", "webSite": "https://inkwell.ewancroft.uk", "authorName": "Ewan Croft", "authorWebSite": "https://ewancroft.uk", "name": {"en-US": "Inkwell"}, "summary": {"en-US": "AT Protocol reader and writer for Standard.site"}, "description": {"en-US": "Inkwell is a native reader and writer for the Standard.site publishing\necosystem on AT Protocol.\n\nThis is an experimental Android companion to Inkwell for iOS, the primary\nclient. It is a work in progress toward feature parity, so expect rough\nedges.\n\nRead site.standard.publication and site.standard.document records directly\nfrom the author's PDS. Renders Leaflet block content, Markpub/plain text,\nand other formats generically so nothing is silently dropped. Resolves\ndisplay themes from Leaflet's rich palette through basicTheme to Material 3\ndefaults. Rich-text facets (bold, italic, code, links) are rendered inline.\nComments are supported: load, submit, and reply on any document.\n\nDiscover publications via the cross-platform public index, then fetches\nauthoritative records from the author. Subscribe to publications and\nrecommend documents, with live recommend counts from Constellation\n(microcosm.blue). Paginated feed with previous/next navigation.\n\nWrite and publish site.standard.document records with portable metadata.\nContent format selection now determines the actual published content union:\nLeaflet block arrays, Markpub markdown, pckt, or Offprint formats are all\nsupported, with inline facets preserved. textContent is always stored as\nportable plaintext.\n\nVerifies publications and documents against their claimed domain via\nStandard.site's .well-known and link-tag checks, shown as a badge on the\npost detail screen.\n\nAuthentication is OAuth-based with your AT Protocol handle — no app\npassword required. Silent session restoration on relaunch.\n\nInkwell is free, with no ads, tracking, or in-app purchases. All code is\nAGPL-3.0."}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/icons/uk.ewancroft.inkwell.6.png", "sha256": "15fe456a7d8cedd4ec44ad0caa8dd4ab6339d2858367dbfd003b58ad4482aa49", "size": 415}}, "preferredSigner": "1a020456e99f560f79a7cefa7a80fbcf9730fdf57f03a15f560f5e5e21815793"}, "versions": {"34588175f0f9df520a5a08c2bfe5bf8751ffc505b1044a2dd8f32216c4065e1f": {"added": 1786863087000, "file": {"name": "/Inkwell-1.3.1.apk", "sha256": "34588175f0f9df520a5a08c2bfe5bf8751ffc505b1044a2dd8f32216c4065e1f", "size": 2558012}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "armeabi-v7a", "x86", "x86_64"], "versionName": "1.3.1", "versionCode": 6, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 26, "targetSdkVersion": 36}, "signer": {"sha256": ["1a020456e99f560f79a7cefa7a80fbcf9730fdf57f03a15f560f5e5e21815793"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.INTERNET"}, {"name": "android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS"}, {"name": "uk.ewancroft.inkwell.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION"}]}}, "ea6f66e2cdd9d42036613c6d39bbfcfa3523706cb4027105bbeb97b324d9a1a7": {"added": 1786844105000, "file": {"name": "/Inkwell-1.2.0.apk", "sha256": "ea6f66e2cdd9d42036613c6d39bbfcfa3523706cb4027105bbeb97b324d9a1a7", "